/**
 * Pinegrap - Enterprise Website Platform
 *
 * General venue blocks the core's Hours & Locations group lacks. Spaces to
 * hire: a card per room, hall or terrace with its picture, how many it
 * seats, its size and layout, what it comes with, a starting price and a
 * way to ask for a date. A hotel's meeting rooms, an event venue's halls, a
 * coworking floor or a museum's rentals place it with their own content.
 * The core's Locations: Cards keeps the branch cards (address, hours,
 * phone). The floor directory: a building's floors from the top down, each
 * with its level, what is on it and who may go up, for a coworking house,
 * a hotel, a museum or a shopping arcade. Zones: the rings around a base
 * drawn beside each zone's places, its fee and how soon it is served, then
 * the time slots and the cut-off time for the same day. The labels name no
 * trade: a florist, a bakery or a pharmacy places it as delivery zones, a
 * plumber, a cleaner or a repair service as the areas it calls out to.
 * Map of places: the records of the page's form list (a collection with
 * latitude and longitude) as cards with a search box; assets/js/pg_map.js
 * fills it on the page (data-pg-map). The canvas shows a still picture of a
 * map with three markers and three sample cards, which the page drops.
 *
 * @author      Erdal Güral (Kodpen)
 * @link        https://kodpen.com
 * @copyright   2017–2026 Kodpen
 * @license     Proprietary, see license-editors.txt
 */
